exports[`git.release.p2 permission requirements given: [case-perm-commit-only] a commit grant with no release grant when: [t0] apply with an unlimited commit grant alone then: exit 2: a commit grant never ships 1`] = `
"🐢 bummer dude...

🐚 git.release --mode apply
   └─ ✋ ConstraintError: no release grant on this tree

🥥 did you know?
   ├─ a commit grant never ships; a release needs its own stamp, which only your human can grant
   └─ git.release.uses set --quant 1
"
`;

