🐚 git.release --mode apply
   └─ ✋ ConstraintError: releases blocked at 2 levels
      ├─ releases blocked globally
      └─ no release grant on this tree

🥥 did you know?
   ├─ each level must allow a release; ask your human to grant each
   ├─ git.release.uses allow --global
   └─ git.release.uses set --quant 1
"
`;

exports[`git.release.p2 permission requirements given: [case-perm-global-damaged] apply mode with a 0-byte global release blocker when: [t0] apply reads the damaged blocker then: exit 1: fails closed and names the file 1`] = `
"🐢 bummer dude...

🐚 git.release --mode apply
   └─ 💥 MalfunctionError: release blocker file corrupt

🥥 did you know?
   ├─ the global blocker file cannot be read, so every release is blocked; a human may read it, then clear it
   ├─ cat ~/.rhachet/storage/repo=ehmpathy/role=mechanic/.meter/git.release.uses.jsonc
   └─ rm -r ~/.rhachet/storage/repo=ehmpathy/role=mechanic/.meter/git.release.uses.jsonc
"
`;

