exports[`git.release.p2 permission requirements given: [case-perm-unpushed] the branch holds commits its pr lacks (F14) when: [t0] apply with two commits not yet pushed then: exit 2: names the count and the push, spends no use 1`] = `
"🐢 bummer dude...

🐚 git.release --mode apply
   └─ ✋ ConstraintError: 2 unpushed commit(s) on turtle/feature-x

🥥 did you know?
   ├─ the pr holds only what was pushed; push first, then release
   ├─ a push rides the commit grant, not the release stamp; if push refuses, ask your human for git.commit.uses set --quant N
   └─ rhx git.commit.push --mode apply
"
`;

exports[`git.release.p2 permission requirements given: [case-perm-unpushed] the branch holds commits its pr lacks (F14) when: [t2] apply with no origin/<branch> ref to count against then: exit 1: a count it cannot read never passes as zero 1`] = `
